@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@apiKey = classroom-demo-key

### List events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events

### Filter, sort, and paginate
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?category=Workshop&isPublished=true&sortBy=title&order=asc&page=1&limit=5

### Upcoming published events
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/upcoming

### One event
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/2

### Invalid id (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/nope

### Event sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/2/sessions

### Missing event (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events/9999

### Invalid pagination (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?page=hello

### Invalid sort field (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/events?sortBy=location

### Create event without key (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Missing key", "description": "Demo", "location": "Campus", "eventDate": "2030-06-15T10:00:00.000Z", "category": "Talk", "isPublished": true }

### Create event with wrong key (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
x-api-key: wrong-key
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Wrong key", "description": "Demo", "location": "Campus", "eventDate": "2030-06-15T10:00:00.000Z", "category": "Talk", "isPublished": true }

### Create event with valid key (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Campus Film Night", "description": "A student film screening.", "location": "Lecture Hall A", "eventDate": "2030-06-15T10:00:00.000Z", "category": "Arts", "isPublished": true }

### Invalid body (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "description": "", "location": "", "eventDate": "not-a-date", "category": "Talk", "isPublished": "yes" }

### Unknown body field (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Extra field", "description": "Demo", "location": "Campus", "eventDate": "2030-06-15T10:00:00.000Z", "category": "Talk", "isPublished": true, "admin": true }
